<body>
    <h1>Agentic AI Platform: Terraform Module Design</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-right-sidebar" data-layout=3D"two-right-side=
bar">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"7e8160c280e3">This page aims to provide terraform module reg=
istry solution including tool selection between git and JFrog Artifactory f=
or backend approach.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c1174d24737a">This also baselines upon the latest structure =
at <code>data-ai-genai-platform-agentic-gw-pattern</code> repo.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d54d2c7f660c">There are two modernization initiatives, and t=
hey should be implemented together as one platform operating model:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ca20745e-f52e-41e3-a4f5-9b5be527bd6e">
<li local-id=3D"4501c9d7-83f9-4c8c-bba8-8efc463b5e07">
<p local-id=3D"58d07fce68bb">Build and release the application once, then p=
romote the same immutable release through dev =E2=86=92 test =E2=86=92 qual=
 =E2=86=92 prod.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d02406f2-0b3a-4e86-bbc1-74513a1f0728">
<p local-id=3D"abd7f7339950">Make the application repository a thin Terrafo=
rm composition layer that consumes versioned AgentCore platform modules.</p=
></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"7bd62416d9de">This page focuses on initiative 2.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell aside" data-type=3D"aside">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<style type=3D"text/css">/*<![CDATA[*/
