</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h2 local-id=3D"ae9bff3fe584" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-TerraformModuleModel">Terraform Module Model</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"d70c03b9c665" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Purpose">Purpose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c3b5d49dd66c">Defines the minimum viable operating model for=
 reusable Terraform modules used by the AgentCore platform pattern. It sepa=
rates platform resource implementation from application configuration and e=
stablishes controlled module releases through Azure DevOps and JFrog Artifa=
ctory.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9fdcdcf2a643">The model assumes Azure Repos is the source-co=
ntrol system, repositories are in one Azure DevOps project, JFrog is availa=
ble at <code>artifactory.aws-ocm.nz</code>, and Terraform state remains in =
the existing environment-specific AWS S3 backends.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"bee9de1530c8" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Goals">Goals</h3>
<p local-id=3D"7ee28f6abdbf">The model provides reusable platform capabilit=
ies, immutable module versions, pre-publication validation, explicit applic=
ation version selection, release traceability, and consistent promotion thr=
ough dev, test, qual, and prod.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2c01244f2ad5">It does nothing against existing model, e.g. t=
erraform state or deployment template.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"2735a53fc630" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Targetarchitecture">Target architecture</h3>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p local-id=3D"e0d103eb1cb7">The proposed target architecture retains Git a=
s the system of record for Terraform module development, collaboration, and=
 peer review, while using JFrog Artifactory as the controlled release and c=
onsumption layer. This separation provides clear traceability from source c=
ode to published module versions, supports controlled promotion across envi=
ronments, and establishes a scalable foundation for broader platform adopti=
on.</p>
<p local-id=3D"dd328f4aa412">This recommendation is based on the assumption=
 that Platform &amp; Tooling (DP), including Tony S. and Nick K., has confi=
rmed JFrog Artifactory as a long-term enterprise capability within AirNZ. J=
Frog is preferred over a Git-only distribution model because it provides pu=
rpose-built artifact distribution, centralised access control, auditability=
, improved module discovery and consumption, and a stronger path to scale. =
It also reduces risks associated with mutable or misused Git tags, branch-b=
ased consumption, and repository restructuring affecting application consum=
ers.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"a67b66ed6377"></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wr=
apper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-im=
age confluence-external-resource" height=3D"106" width=3D"468" src=3D"ef3a8=
47ba76afa47303c11c8525f18c3ecf2f96bf14edabcd20867ca4e526bdb" data-image-src=
=3D"/wiki/download/attachments/1866203194/Terraform%20Module%20Model.drawio=
.png?api=3Dv2" loading=3D"lazy"></span>
<p local-id=3D"0e33cd9dd5e3">For the MVP, application repositories may cons=
ume the local repository directly. The virtual repository is reserved as a =
stable aggregation endpoint when multiple internal or approved remote modul=
e sources are required.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"cabf63495a8e" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Modulesourcerepository">Module source repository</h3>
<p local-id=3D"01e25e4191ef">Create one centrally owned repository:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">terrafo=
rm-aws-agentcore-modules/
=E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 modules/
=E2=94=82   =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 runtime/
=E2=94=82   =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 runtime-workflow/
=E2=94=82   =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 gateway/
=E2=94=82   =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 memory/
=E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 examples/complete/
=E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 tests/
=E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 .azure-pipeline/module-ci.yml
=E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 .azure-pipeline/module-release.yml
=E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 README.md</pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"863" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"d280a3db-a0da-4f7a-85b7-1e951aa2f2fd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 194.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 669.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0968c958-8979-4006-9df7-30aaa6e63074">
<th data-local-id=3D"5effa68a-e092-4f8a-a258-fd2b7b311529" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"44e8387f0460">Module</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"cc798725-5c1e-4138-a4c9-b2a8af479a4a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7242aa1de724">Responsibility</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dad67556-7f6f-4db8-a3fb-061c9cf0bd86">
<td data-local-id=3D"97ca70f2-04a8-43f7-b0be-3642faed06fd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ead6fb1df782"><code>runtime</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c973a571-e2eb-4a4e-953b-62d3dc178286" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d1413648296d">AgentCore runtimes, runtime IAM, logging, and =
runtime configuration</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b17dd69c-747d-47da-b6e3-d615fe35f7cb">
<td data-local-id=3D"3e0f8e5e-6d85-412f-a998-3b7c85faa1ce" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"09ee2a9473f9"><code>runtime-workflow</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bebd4766-d607-4eb1-91d9-45a6b549ea2b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"940a568b283c">Workflow orchestration and runtime relationshi=
ps</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2a25cfdc-7c8c-4788-bc91-d0e3d90bdb14">
<td data-local-id=3D"118d22f5-0d54-459b-af28-9a82613fc7db" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"28787c5d2ca0"><code>gateway</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1c97e33c-d0b8-4732-84ba-b78c25045fd5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"099d14e7a14d">Gateway resources and authorization configurat=
ion</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"75414104-ef50-4c78-a3f3-c880301c0f46">
<td data-local-id=3D"090550cf-1fac-4b42-b597-c17dfbf5a661" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8f1d89bf61da"><code>memory</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ec9ec6ca-57b8-4b07-a79f-b1a8b2771784" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"95e22ebbb831">Long-term memory, retention, and index configu=
ration</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"c8f7ed0e2398">Modules must not contain application-specific =
business logic or environment state backends.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"f72a9d4deeed" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-JFrogrepositorymodel">JFrog repository model</h3>
<p local-id=3D"0c35c06d9ec4">Create the following JFrog repositories:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"950" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"d5634743-b704-4809-931f-2a41c8d4fbf7" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 280.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 266.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 401.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4810ee3d-1fb8-49ca-bee4-fe48ca7834ad">
<th data-local-id=3D"dbce00af-c299-4891-bbf0-67d50ce2d398" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c039907e22e4">Repository</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"173a91f8-fdf8-4bda-a5ab-3bcfe34d672e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9cc163befb0d">Type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1f4cbb7d-848a-4a37-858f-f05b20b5fe43" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0560bd5e75e4">Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"18e7feff-3227-49c1-9bc4-a28417b96a3a">
<td data-local-id=3D"d088da62-8e53-4b88-a702-ff6c825bb83a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"322d601dc7de"><code>terraform-agentcore-local</code></p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"fa40b7c7-5d9c-4761-9881-21b1a76c8bc0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef6cb4c2bd75">Local Terraform repository</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3c53e9b0-1566-4f85-bc50-59324d5d0fd6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27d0699d8a03">Publication target for internal modules</p></t=
d>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"d48223e8d31f">Use namespace <code>airnz-agentcore</code> and=
 provider <code>aws</code>. For the MVP, a module is consumed from the loca=
l repository as follows:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">module =
"runtime" {
  source  =3D "artifactory.aws-ocm.nz/terraform-agentcore-local__airnz-agen=
tcore/runtime/aws"
  version =3D "1.0.0"

  application_name  =3D local.application_name
  environment       =3D var.environment
  runtime_image_uri =3D var.runtime_image_uri
  runtimes          =3D var.runtimes
  base_tags         =3D local.base_tags
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"9af0d29ceb00" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Modulecontract">Module contract</h3>
<div id=3D"expander-772948008" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-772948008" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"ccaee117077eaa4bfbfaf6b5e78d2ac5f44db1=
000dd1ff49eca4bfd3cddbb364" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Each module must document and validate:</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-772948008" class=3D"expand-content">
<ul local-id=3D"5a42fe60-58a5-44e8-88bd-a6b527c2e64d">
<li local-id=3D"1d994659-7f25-40fc-bb4f-381c772ba93a">
<p local-id=3D"a39da12620cc">Required and optional inputs.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"018c7c04-0674-49c1-a95e-bc2efb636404">
<p local-id=3D"104ee6b657f0">Input types and validation rules.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ea09289b-8fa8-49ed-87e9-465c07f7afe2">
<p local-id=3D"30b77a35f0e1">Outputs intended for composition.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"87c56f88-4085-47a6-ba4d-b3f14a940caa">
<p local-id=3D"621efb82e7b2">Supported Terraform and AWS provider versions.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a104554-77b8-41f5-ba0b-3fd71bdee19d">
<p local-id=3D"83bfca3828f0">Naming and tagging behaviour.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b2e02415-62bf-4e91-83f4-f470e98f02eb">
<p local-id=3D"96aaf10f9e57">IAM permissions created by the module.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"9046848b-f7ec-4b5f-8cf0-67df433477f7">
<p local-id=3D"4e2f1af8fcf3">Upgrade, migration, and unsupported-use-case g=
uidance.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-1892533240" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1892533240" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"ccaee117077eaa4bfbfaf6b5e78d2ac5f44db1=
000dd1ff49eca4bfd3cddbb364" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Platform guardrails should be implemented inside t=
he modules, including:</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1892533240" class=3D"expand-content">
<ul local-id=3D"34f21a66-5cf1-4c63-9867-57c9740f5cc5">
<li local-id=3D"596fd688-c1f5-41ca-b234-b340e45fcd40">
<p local-id=3D"39189eb09e5b">Mandatory Air New Zealand tags.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"64094eb2-f0ce-4250-88f5-f0f67fed20da">
<p local-id=3D"8669eb6d32a7">Encryption where supported.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"444b05a4-d3c9-4eb2-b7df-236fdbbf3bac">
<p local-id=3D"e6647ab8af78">CloudWatch logging and retention.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7b78fc3-f61e-455e-a7fa-359143dc471b">
<p local-id=3D"313df3098370">Least-privilege IAM policies.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aebbf4af-3aee-4d12-93da-b47412ad8fc3">
<p local-id=3D"07a95db77714">Public-access prevention.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"33ee66ad-c2a0-4acd-b46a-8fbc8501b659">
<p local-id=3D"e13e53dbef39">Approved regions and service configurations.</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"afcb8f4c-190c-401e-a693-0b8dd8825e89">
<p local-id=3D"893632f4b756">Stable resource naming.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"17d4377ff7f8" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Versioningandreleasepolicy">Versioning and release policy</h3>
<p local-id=3D"9692a77d2368">Use immutable semantic versions:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">1.0.0  =
# initial compatible release
1.1.0  # backward-compatible feature
1.1.1  # backward-compatible fix
2.0.0  # breaking contract or behaviour change</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"0a4f72f9e7a0">Never overwrite a published JFrog version. The=
 first release may use a coordinated version for all modules:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">runtime=
           1.0.0
runtime-workflow  1.0.0
gateway           1.0.0
memory            1.0.0</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"5460f711c5f0">Release metadata must record module name, vers=
ion, source commit, JFrog repository, publication timestamp, and compatibil=
ity information.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8b1095f112fd" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-CIandreleaseworkflow">CI and release workflow</h3>
<div id=3D"expander-151640838" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-151640838" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"ccaee117077eaa4bfbfaf6b5e78d2ac5f44db1=
000dd1ff49eca4bfd3cddbb364" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Pull request validation</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-151640838" class=3D"expand-content">
<p local-id=3D"0f0d7ec0-bda1-41c5-9dd8-fb24bdff7916">The module CI pipeline=
 must run:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"69ca6588-16cb-4676-9b23-b6c06d97d9b4">
<li local-id=3D"1144f940-feb2-4fdc-aae1-9255393fc3ec">
<p local-id=3D"3131c534378f"><code>terraform fmt -check</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a57ff1cd-9970-43ce-acb2-dd8970dd0531">
<p local-id=3D"813e2ef03303"><code>terraform init</code> and <code>terrafor=
m validate</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"015d8abe-978a-4ab1-b763-ef78faf2b2a2">
<p local-id=3D"4bae4ba61ccb">Example configuration plans.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"96d1fe8d-c803-4c7b-98f5-b0e1b2b4136d">
<p local-id=3D"682d7de917bf">Terraform security scanning.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e6cc84d9-12bb-45f4-8b49-200ceb03fd4c">
<p local-id=3D"e2a99810bd3f">Policy checks for encryption, tagging, IAM, lo=
gging, and public access.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"19c21d0f-aaec-4c50-94fd-1ed74efd42a6">
<p local-id=3D"a5004115a553">Module contract tests.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"152a240a-ad41-48ce-a8a2-49353f156bce">
<p local-id=3D"8a95225ab054">Documentation and interface checks.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14fbbdf3-e676-4440-8540-e6c72680353e">
<p local-id=3D"0701b0ba017b">Terraform and AWS provider compatibility check=
s.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"d92917f4fc86">Pull request pipelines must not publish module=
s to JFrog.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-614729440" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-614729440" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"ccaee117077eaa4bfbfaf6b5e78d2ac5f44db1=
000dd1ff49eca4bfd3cddbb364" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Release publication</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-614729440" class=3D"expand-content">
<p local-id=3D"5c02e7a5-dfbc-4275-82bf-74fd10981345">After main-branch vali=
dation and approval, the release pipeline must:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d8aecdcc-3e3f-4d6b-a743-06ec3991cc8a">
<li local-id=3D"fc035476-1381-4f4a-b0db-496c7c5444d8">
<p local-id=3D"ba5e81ea56e1">Validate the release commit again.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"46d6709b-4845-465a-bc5d-20a0b6b861f9">
<p local-id=3D"ce4d1029e26d">Run integration tests.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"347ea675-64b0-476d-b77b-9f8a9450d9e1">
<p local-id=3D"be78f79f7e6d">Validate the semantic version.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1a36ee05-531b-4034-90f9-8548c81305a6">
<p local-id=3D"e033ec9b9153">Publish each module to <code>terraform-agentco=
re-local</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"945c2a95-6b85-43c4-93db-999eb5f1da8f">
<p local-id=3D"2db48389d641">Resolve each module through the consumer endpo=
int.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0d1a766c-af92-4cc5-a543-12b1d9faf4e5">
<p local-id=3D"1015baf87780">Generate release metadata and notes.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"364c9814-e617-46d6-95e5-a8473f9a1352">
<p local-id=3D"5572d4cf5362">Make the release immutable.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"fa9074e75b10">The release identity should have deploy permis=
sion only for the module repository. Application deployment identities requ=
ire read permission only.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"40bc1a8ecbb3" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Applicationrepositoryresponsibilities">Application repository responsibili=
ties</h3>
<p local-id=3D"9a9652815e05">The gateway-pattern application repository sho=
uld contain:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"badd505b-0b0f-455d-bbc9-6b99aad38957">
<li local-id=3D"0f5a65d6-d7d8-410e-b478-91b55e71409e">
<p local-id=3D"72af1e7f7936">Module calls and explicit module versions.</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"2e88aa27-d4d7-429e-bfab-329eca035f8b">
<p local-id=3D"d2ec09d95080">Runtime and workflow declarations.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7e6634a-29c3-4229-afaa-9dd0f5c54b17">
<p local-id=3D"a8a111f5f00c">Environment-specific values.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7b1d1846-5115-43da-a3d0-e28419f1be6a">
<p local-id=3D"4997db905321">Provider and backend configuration.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"12469184-aa43-43ae-9537-518da25819c5">
<p local-id=3D"2f169bbdc498">Application-level validation and checks.</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"7b95207a-c9f8-4ca5-97ce-a2f70f8ac61c">
<p local-id=3D"c0d261445e01">Application outputs and integration tests.</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"4e61da8ccd1d">It should not directly define resources that b=
elong to the shared AgentCore platform modules. Module versions should be d=
eclared in one visible location, such as <code>infra/versions.tf</code>.</p=
>
<h3 local-id=3D"a0c776a44985" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Environmentpromotion">Environment promotion</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ca9172f15179">The application release must carry immutable c=
ontainer and Terraform module references:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "release_id": "agentic-gw-20261001.42",
  "source_commit": "abc123",
  "images": { "runtime": "sha256:..." },
  "terraform_modules": {
    "runtime": "1.0.0",
    "runtime-workflow": "1.0.0",
    "gateway": "1.0.0",
    "memory": "1.0.0"
  }
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"e54d7fecdb4e">The same release manifest must be used for dev=
, test, qual, and prod. Only environment-specific values such as AWS accoun=
t, backend, networking, and secrets references may change. Non-development =
environments must not rebuild containers or silently resolve a different mo=
dule version.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"54bad61f3241" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Authenticationandaccess">Authentication and access</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"04d89580-1d88-49d9-bc1f-a1f25ddd1902">
<li local-id=3D"479ecae7-0e4f-4049-aac0-3fb8c75b52f2">
<p local-id=3D"7da4d27ac693">Use a dedicated JFrog service identity for mod=
ule publication.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"090d9fe9-448f-4cf7-be8d-c57371d89c42">
<p local-id=3D"a5f37c8f0967">Store the JFrog access token in an ADO secret =
variable group or service connection.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"50895923-0edf-481b-b7c9-f9b26a0c0fc7">
<p local-id=3D"93eb87195125">Grant publication permission only to the modul=
e release pipeline.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0af76d5e-da3d-4fae-ad32-bd5d258e343d">
<p local-id=3D"d0bc49b8f4f9">Grant read permission to application deploymen=
t pipelines.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35d05407-3a04-4799-9fab-539bc773c6e0">
<p local-id=3D"524b6066ada5">Do not store tokens in Terraform source or rep=
ository files.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7f67cf79-7aae-4bc1-8f1b-cd72de464d6c">
<p local-id=3D"5b10f39a9b67">Create temporary Terraform/JFrog credentials o=
nly on the build agent.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c46fba7d-95a8-490e-bd5c-5113bbe5cc25">
<p local-id=3D"8c8dd880f34b">Remove temporary credentials during pipeline c=
leanup.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"70971a90884a" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Ownership">Ownership</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e=
229cfe3-0664-45a3-aebb-c87893ab0e79" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8f20e18f-5910-4b77-8844-93eea4da1ece">
<th data-local-id=3D"59dd9806-fe70-4ede-8f1f-3129d0258589" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"03abb2df24c0">Area</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"74c01df1-7e6c-4990-9177-2b3f998515aa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bda5f9cbba2b">Primary owner</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0e4e804d-4a33-438f-a14f-2669fa06aad3">
<td data-local-id=3D"24fed62e-a17f-443e-ae7e-50ed97c65e35" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a12ee7aee5df">Module implementation</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4a7a456e-0e78-4592-869a-63d0aa8dfed7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5947feb54323">AI Tooling / Agentic AI platform team</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"74205da3-0ad3-4e3a-a20d-4f437d236c7d">
<td data-local-id=3D"fd1789ec-2a04-41d6-8ce8-fce9a2101ca7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a38c7190b511">Module contract and compatibility</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cdfccd5d-5db8-4d2f-95aa-162432927fab" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1b8d32c469f7">Platform engineering</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"83049e89-1205-4f38-9014-99c360c171d9">
<td data-local-id=3D"c8977133-d2d9-40ee-931a-859e485c7114" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f75d1b74fb37">JFrog administration</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5edfc81c-fbfd-4389-923d-580d4af4546a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"654760e6d1e8">Platform &amp; Tooling team (DP)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"73f1f2f4-6b7f-48ee-80a6-5f990f0d37f0">
<td data-local-id=3D"d7c48914-8503-461f-9064-6b5650c31799" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf2e911e2932">Application configuration</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8f8119a6-5149-40a2-b7f4-de7379f49faf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29500e35697c">Application team</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"c993abf9b9d8" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-ActionPlan">Action Plan</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"92c990e8-89ee-4f06-a16b-de5f43f9b465">
<li local-id=3D"a558a118-a792-4df9-8055-82a1a85fd9c4">
<p local-id=3D"20017defa12b">Extract runtime, workflow, gateway, and memory=
 resources into the central module repository.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5a484ea3-b5f0-4e78-81bc-fc6d3ed4048b">
<p local-id=3D"bca968018f91">Add module CI validation and examples.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"927e14e3-1437-455a-a764-b21eb79c8fc4">
<p local-id=3D"f1444b3c9fb9">Publish the first immutable JFrog versions.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a51b608-fb20-43b9-a48d-b8b80c2d11b1">
<p local-id=3D"0f4fd6cc263c">Replace local resource definitions with module=
 calls in this repository.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e5d003f8-f95e-4224-8249-33e524bc9c9d">
<p local-id=3D"42e7323ad1ef">Add module version metadata to the release man=
ifest.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d365939d-14a9-455b-8777-177ceac7bf9f">
<p local-id=3D"00f8190c2f5f">Run dev using the published modules.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b859edea-ae8d-4cb2-8c89-8dc9fc90f0ea">
<p local-id=3D"db0679e69b8b">Validate test and qual with the same module ve=
rsions.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fb645759-36d6-498b-99f7-284a8d508115">
<p local-id=3D"327301b5c818">Promote to prod after approval and PAC checks.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9edb942-1f33-4969-876f-85960ed03e7e">
<p local-id=3D"3e527d7d929a">Remove duplicated platform resource code after=
 migration succeeds.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"95cc943146b3" id=3D"AgenticAIPlatform:TerraformModuleDesign=
-Acceptancecriteria">Acceptance criteria</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"4e8a887c-79b9-4fd8-b317-a20af37923d3">
<li local-id=3D"224566c9-9d35-42eb-b91f-4e619c507988">
<p local-id=3D"b8c4fb0fca10">All four capabilities are published as version=
ed JFrog modules.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"934398bd-f84a-444a-b64f-a4016388c291">
<p local-id=3D"adc4c453d4be">A new application can consume the modules with=
out copying platform resources.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"294fa41f-d7d1-4810-954e-a0db8e764ad0">
<p local-id=3D"862d949760bc">Pull requests validate modules before publicat=
ion.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"08ac2423-dbd2-4c75-ae85-1a889cabed69">
<p local-id=3D"3a80a3a447c0">Published versions cannot be overwritten.</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"0897df19-4149-4ebe-b408-25a15e5f2e17">
<p local-id=3D"148d5dad77b3">This pattern consumes explicit module versions=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14e6f96b-65db-42a7-b850-9bfc47aec6a8">
<p local-id=3D"fa8eee143f19">Release manifests record module versions and i=
mage digests.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3f90cbb6-9172-4116-90a5-558b43a2c812">
<p local-id=3D"aae58b6211ba">Dev, test, qual, and prod use the same module =
versions for a release.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a6eb61f1-edb9-436c-8910-9285e47bb4c2">
<p local-id=3D"73b8c317861c">Production does not rebuild containers or reso=
lve unapproved module versions.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fec9b3fd-f68b-41bf-9edd-42349d7484c6">
<p local-id=3D"8acdd599ee38">Terraform state remains isolated in the existi=
ng environment-specific S3 backends.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
